Snake Plant is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found only in [[Act 2]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Snake Plant}}
'''Every turn:'''
* {{Int|Snake Plant|Chomp Chomp}} 65% chance
* {{Int|Snake Plant|Enfeebling Spores}} 35% chance

Cannot use {{Int|Snake Plant|Chomp Chomp}} three times in a row and cannot use {{Int|Snake Plant|Enfeebling Spores}} twice in a row.

<!-- Does this pattern repeat, or return to the randomized moves after? -->
On {{Asc|17|Ascension}}, when it uses {{Int|Snake Plant|Enfeebling Spores}} for the first time, its pattern changes to: 
* {{Int|Snake Plant|Chomp Chomp}}
* {{Int|Snake Plant|Chomp Chomp}}
* {{Int|Snake Plant|Enfeebling Spores}}

